feat: self-growth engine v2 — MCP discovery, API keys, quality scoring, deeper automation

This round adds the last layer of professionalism: AI-agent discoverability,
enterprise API key support, data quality gates, and expanded distribution.

NEW MODULES:
- lib/mcp-discovery.js: Standard .well-known/mcp.json for Claude Desktop /
  Cursor / Windsurf auto-registration. Includes all tools, pricing, payment
  config, trust links, rate limits, and policy statements in one doc.
- lib/api-keys.js: Pre-paid token system for enterprise clients who prefer
  Bearer auth over x402 per-call signing. Wallet-bound, txHash-verified,
  daily hard limits, IP whitelist, 30-day expiry. Keys are hashed (SHA-256),
  never stored in plaintext; only fingerprint exposed publicly.
- scripts/quality-score.js: Source quality scoring (freshness ×0.4 + consistency
  ×0.3 + completeness ×0.3). Sources below threshold auto-degraded from hotlist.
  Scores persisted to data/packs/quality-scores.json.
- docs/AUTO-SCALE-ENGINE-V2.md: Full roadmap covering Phase 1–3 (MCP onboarding,
  multi-language, partnership network, predictive trend engine).

ENDPOINT ENHANCEMENTS:
- GET /.well-known/mcp — MCP Protocol v2024-11-05 discovery doc
- POST /api/keys/create — create pre-paid API key (wallet + txHash required)
- GET /api/keys/list — list all key fingerprints (no sensitive data)
- DELETE /api/keys/:id — revoke a key
- GET /api/status — now includes uptimeSeconds, memory rss/heap MB,
  lastSettledAt timestamp, alert queue pending count

CRON EXPANSION:
- Added daily-digest tasks (4x/day at UTC+8 0h/6h/12h/18h)
- Added weekly-channel-analysis (Monday 05:25)
- Total: 12 autotasker tasks, other projects' 6 lines untouched

DEPLOY PROTECTION:
- data/api-keys.json, data/channel-stats.json, data/digest/, data/content/
  added to REMOTE_ONLY in deploy-v6.py so deploys never overwrite accumulated state

VERIFICATION: prod audit 57/57 PASS; extended-prod-smoke 18/18 PASS
(new endpoints: mcp, api-keys, status-uptime-memory all green).
